    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">
            <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">CONTENTS</div>
        </div>
        <ul class="toc-list" style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <li><a href="#sec1">1. Why should we, as oral health professionals, help tobacco users quit?</a> <span>{{ toc_page_1 }}</span></li>
