            <li><a href="#sec2_2">2.2 The 5Rs model to increase motivation to quit</a> <span>{{ toc_page_2_2 }}</span></li>
            <li><a href="#sec3">3. What should we, as oral health professionals, not recommend for tobacco users trying to quit?</a> <span>{{ toc_page_3 }}</span></li>
